"slash-commands:run slash commands>` to manage your integration settings "
"by typing the commands into the Mattermost message text box, and "
"selecting **Send**:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:47
msgid ""
"``/msteams connect``: Connect your Mattermost account to Microsoft Teams "
"account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:48
msgid ""
"``/msteams disconnect``: Disconnect your Mattermost account from "
"Microsoft Teams account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams.rst:49
